<title>USA: Renters Choice names Wilbanks CFO.</title>
<headline>Renters Choice names Wilbanks CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renters Choice Inc said Wednesday it named Danny Wilbanks as senior vice president-finance and chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Wilbanks, 41, served as president and chief executive officer of Trans Texas Capital, LLC, a rental purchase company, from January 1995 to March 1997.  The rental purchase operations of Trans Texas were recently acquired by Renters Choice.</p>
